msgid "Shown when the chat opens, in the visitor's language. Plain text only (HTML is removed). Maximum %d characters. Leave a field empty to restore its default."
msgstr "打开聊天时以访客的语言显示。仅限纯文本（HTML 会被移除）。最多 %d 个字符。留空则恢复默认值。"

