msgid "Interface language and preferred answer language when the visitor has not chosen one. Source content is not altered."
msgstr "访客未选择语言时使用的界面语言和首选回答语言。不会修改源内容。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:182
msgid "Let visitors switch between English, Bahasa Indonesia, 한국어, 日本語 and 简体中文 in the chat header."
msgstr "允许访客在聊天标题栏中切换 English、Bahasa Indonesia、한국어、日本語 和 简体中文。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:183
msgid "Start in the visitor's browser language when it is supported; otherwise use the default language."
msgstr "如果支持访客的浏览器语言，则以该语言开始；否则使用默认语言。"

#. translators: %s: approved hostnames.
#: includes/class-admin-page.php:203
#, php-format
msgid "WhatsApp number (e.g. +6281234567890), email address (e.g. info@inpartnerglobal.com), or an absolute https:// URL on an approved domain: %s."
msgstr "WhatsApp 号码（例如 +6281234567890）、电子邮箱地址（例如 info@inpartnerglobal.com），或已批准域名上的绝对 https:// URL：%s。"

