msgstr "配置 AI 咨询助手、默认语言和后端连接。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:264
msgid "AI backend"
msgstr "AI 后端"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:266
msgid "Configured."
msgstr "已配置。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:267
msgid "The backend URL and shared secret are read from wp-config.php and are never shown here or sent to browsers."
msgstr "后端 URL 和共享密钥从 wp-config.php 读取，不会在此处显示，也不会发送到浏览器。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:269
msgid "Not configured."
msgstr "未配置。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:270
msgid "The widget stays hidden until WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_BACKEND_URL (https) and WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET (32+ characters) are defined in wp-config.php."
msgstr "在 wp-config.php 中定义 WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_BACKEND_URL（https）和 WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET（至少 32 个字符）之前，聊天窗口将保持隐藏。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:276
msgid "Connection test: backend is reachable, the shared secret is accepted and the knowledge base is ready."
msgstr "连接测试：后端可以访问，共享密钥已被接受，知识库已就绪。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:278
msgid "Connection test failed: the backend rejected the shared secret. Check that WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET matches CHAT_SHARED_SECRET and that the server clock is correct."
msgstr "连接测试失败：后端拒绝了共享密钥。请检查 WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET 是否与 CHAT_SHARED_SECRET 一致，以及服务器时间是否正确。"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:280
msgid "Connection test failed: the backend is running but its knowledge base is empty."
msgstr "连接测试失败：后端正在运行，但其知识库为空。"

