#, php-format
msgid "%1$s — %2$s, %3$d attempt(s) since %4$s UTC"
msgstr "%1$s — %2$s，自 %4$s UTC 起已尝试 %3$d 次"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:371
msgid "Retry now"
msgstr "立即重试"

#: includes/class-admin-page.php:377
msgid "Only pages you sync here enter the knowledge base. After that, edits are sent automatically; unpublishing, trashing, password-protecting or deleting a page removes it. New pages are never added automatically, and password-protected pages are never indexed."
msgstr "只有在此处同步的页面才会进入知识库。此后，编辑内容会自动发送；取消发布、移至回收站、设置密码保护或删除页面会将其移除。新页面不会被自动添加，受密码保护的页面也永远不会被索引。"

