#: includes/class-plugin.php:120
msgid "Chat assistant"
msgstr "聊天助手"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:121
msgid "Questions and answers"
msgstr "问题与回答"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:122
msgid "Visitors can ask questions in a chat assistant. The text of each question is sent to our AI backend service and, together with excerpts of public pages of this website, to Google Gemini to write the answer. The visitor's IP address, cookies and identity are not sent; a salted one-way identifier is used for rate limiting."
msgstr "访客可以在聊天助手中提问。每个问题的文本会发送到我们的 AI 后端服务，并连同本网站公开页面的摘录一起发送给 Google Gemini 以生成回答。不会发送访客的 IP 地址、Cookie 或身份信息；速率限制使用加盐的单向标识符。"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:123
msgid "Conversation storage"
msgstr "对话存储"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:124
msgid "The conversation is kept only in the visitor's browser (session storage) and is cleared when the tab is closed. This site stores short-lived rate-limit counters, aggregate counts of questions and the 25 most recent question snippets, from which e-mail addresses, phone numbers, links and long numbers have been removed."
msgstr "咨询请求"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:125
msgid "Consultation requests"
msgstr "对话仅保存在访客的浏览器中（会话存储），关闭标签页后即被清除。本网站会存储短期的速率限制计数器、问题的汇总数量以及最近 25 条问题摘要（已移除电子邮箱地址、电话号码、链接和长数字）。"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:126
msgid "Visitors can optionally send a consultation request. The name, e-mail address, company, job title, function and message they enter are stored on this site and e-mailed to the site administrator. The IP address is not stored. Requests are kept until an administrator deletes them, or for the retention period the site owner has set, and can be exported or erased through Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal Data."
msgstr "访客可以选择发送咨询请求。他们填写的姓名、电子邮箱地址、公司、职位、职能和留言会保存在本网站，并通过电子邮件发送给网站管理员。不会存储 IP 地址。请求会一直保留，直到管理员将其删除或达到网站所有者设定的保留期限，并可通过“工具”→“导出个人数据”和“抹除个人数据”进行导出或抹除。"

#: includes/class-plugin.php:149
msgid "Every Four Minutes"
msgstr "每四分钟"

