#, php-format
msgid "Contact URL must be a valid WhatsApp number, email address, or an absolute https:// URL on an approved domain (%s), without credentials or a custom port."
msgstr "联系链接必须是有效的 WhatsApp 号码、电子邮箱地址，或已批准域名（%s）上的绝对 https:// URL，且不得包含凭据或自定义端口。"

